1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,610
W: Before we board our plane, do you mind if we do some shopping at the duty-free stores?

2
00:00:05,535 --> 00:00:07,990
I need to buy some souvenirs for my friends.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:09,530
M: Be my guest.

4
00:00:10,455 --> 00:00:13,010
But I've got to head to the gate to speak with somebody there.

5
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:14,810
Take a look at my boarding pass.

6
00:00:16,035 --> 00:00:19,630
W: Oh, I can't believe one of the letters in Thomas is missing.

7
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:24,950
M: Yeah, I want to make sure there aren't any problems when it's time to board.

8
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:26,890
Where shall we meet when I'm done?

9
00:00:27,070 --> 00:00:29,550
W: How about at that coffee shop over there?

10
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:33,340
After I finish shopping, I'd like something to drink.

11
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:34,270
M: Great.

12
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:35,890
I'll see you in a few minutes.
